<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>과수화상병 AI 진단 및 해결 가이드</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts Inter & Noto Sans KR -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        sage: {
                            50: '#f4f7f5',
                            100: '#e3ece5',
                            300: '#A3C1AD',
                            500: '#628373',
                            700: '#2f3e46',
                        },
                        cream: '#FDFBF7',
                        dustyRed: {
                            DEFAULT: '#E07A5F',
                            light: '#F8D8D0',
                            dark: '#C95335'
                        },
                        pearGold: {
                            DEFAULT: '#D8C3A5',
                            light: '#F5EFEB',
                            dark: '#A88D67'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Noto Sans KR', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'soft': '0 10px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)',
                        'float': '0 15px 35px -5px rgba(47, 62, 70, 0.18), 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #FDFBF7;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
            color: #2F3E46;
        }
        
        /* Custom scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #FDFBF7;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #A3C1AD;
            border-radius: 9999px;
        }

        /* Pulse Animation for Alert */
        @keyframes subtlePulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.02); opacity: 0.95; }
        }
        .animate-alert {
            animation: subtlePulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        /* Glassmorphism Floating Navigation */
        .floating-nav {
            position: fixed;
            right: 24px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            z-index: 50;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(163, 193, 173, 0.4);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .floating-nav {
                right: 50%;
                top: auto;
                bottom: 20px;
                transform: translateX(50%);
                flex-direction: row !important;
                padding: 8px 16px !important;
                border-radius: 9999px !important;
            }
        }

        .capsule-btn {
            border-radius: 9999px;
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen relative pb-20">

    <!-- TOP HEADER -->
    <header class="w-full bg-white/80 backdrop-filter blur-md border-b border-sage-100 sticky top-0 z-30">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sage-300 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid font-bold text-xl fa-wheat-awn text-emerald-950"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-sage-700 leading-tight">과수화상병 AI 진단 & 해결 솔루션</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">YOLOv8 기반 정밀 실시간 탐지 및 AI 농가 보조 시스템</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 mr-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-ping"></span>
                    YOLO best.pt 연동 완료
                </span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-pearGold-light text-pearGold-dark border border-pearGold/30">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-apple-whole mr-1"></i> 사과/배 정밀 분석
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ALWAYS VISIBLE FLOATING SIDEBAR NAVIGATION -->
    <aside class="floating-nav flex flex-col items-center space-y-4 py-5 px-3 rounded-full shadow-float">
        <!-- MENU 1: MAIN -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('main')" id="nav-main" class="nav-btn active group relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all bg-sage-500 text-white shadow-md">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up text-lg"></i>
            <!-- Tooltip Desktop -->
            <span class="hidden md:block absolute right-16 bg-sage-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap shadow-md pointer-events-none">
                ① 메인 (Upload & Detect)
            </span>
        </button>

        <!-- MENU 2: GALLERY -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('gallery')" id="nav-gallery" class="nav-btn group relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all text-sage-700 hover:bg-sage-100">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-images text-lg"></i>
            <!-- Tooltip Desktop -->
            <span class="hidden md:block absolute right-16 bg-sage-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap shadow-md pointer-events-none">
                ② 상세 (Gallery & Filter)
            </span>
        </button>

        <!-- MENU 3: CHATBOT -->
        <button onclick="switchTab('chatbot')" id="nav-chatbot" class="nav-btn group relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-all text-sage-700 hover:bg-sage-100">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-robot text-lg"></i>
            <!-- Tooltip Desktop -->
            <span class="hidden md:block absolute right-16 bg-sage-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap shadow-md pointer-events-none">
                ③ AI 챗봇 (Farm Assistant)
            </span>
        </button>

        <div class="hidden md:block w-8 h-[1px] bg-sage-200 my-1"></div>

        <!-- QUICK REPORT ICON -->
        <button onclick="openReportModal()" class="group relative w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-dustyRed text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-md hover:bg-dustyRed-dark transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-sm"></i>
            <span class="hidden md:block absolute right-16 bg-dustyRed text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap shadow-md pointer-events-none">
                1399 긴급 신고
            </span>
        </button>
    </aside>

    <!-- MAIN CONTAINER -->
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8">
        <main class="space-y-8 pr-0 md:pr-16">

            <!-- 1. 메인 페이지 SECTION (Upload & Detect) -->
            <section id="section-main" class="page-section space-y-6">
                
                <!-- TOP SUMMARY WIDGETS -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <!-- Total Inspect -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-sage-100 shadow-soft flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">총 검사 수</p>
                            <h3 id="stat-total" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-sage-700 mt-1">12</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-image mr-1"></i>최근 업로드 포함</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sage-50 text-sage-500 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Normal Apples/Pears -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-sage-100 shadow-soft flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">정상 건수 (사과/배)</p>
                            <h3 id="stat-normal" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 mt-1">8</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle mr-1"></i>정상 생육 상태</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Fire Blight Pear -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-sage-100 shadow-soft flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">배화상병 감염</p>
                            <h3 id="stat-pear-blight" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-600 mt-1">2</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-amber-600 mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-1"></i>주의 및 방제 필요</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-lemon"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Fire Blight Apple -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-sage-100 shadow-soft flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">사과화상병 감염</p>
                            <h3 id="stat-apple-blight" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-dustyRed mt-1">2</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-dustyRed mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-biohazard mr-1"></i>긴급 신고 및 매립 대상</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-dustyRed-light/40 text-dustyRed flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-apple-whole"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- URGENT ALERT BANNER (If Blight Detected) -->
                <div id="urgent-alert" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-dustyRed/95 to-red-600 text-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-lg flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between animate-alert">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 mb-4 md:mb-0">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl flex-shrink-0">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation text-white"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span class="bg-white text-dustyRed font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">긴급 알림</span>
                                <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">과수화상병 의심 감염체 4건 탐지됨</h4>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-sm text-red-100 mt-1">과수화상병은 국가 관리 병해충입니다. 발견 즉시 농업기술센터 신고 및 방제 조치가 필요합니다.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="openReportModal()" class="capsule-btn px-6 py-3 bg-white text-dustyRed font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-red-50 hover:shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2 text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume"></i>
                        <span>1399 신고 다이얼로그</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- DRAG & DROP MULTI-IMAGE UPLOAD -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-sage-100 shadow-soft">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-md-center justify-between pb-6 mb-6 border-b border-gray-100">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-sage-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up text-sage-500"></i>
                                다중 과수 이미지 업로드 & YOLO 분석
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">사과 및 배 과수원 잎/열매 사진을 드래그하여 올리거나 탐색기를 열어주세요.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 flex items-center space-x-3">
                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">모델 상태: <strong class="text-sage-700">best.pt (Active)</strong></span>
                            <button id="btn-run-detection" onclick="simulateYoloDetection()" class="capsule-btn px-6 py-2.5 bg-sage-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-sage-700 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>
                                <span>실시간 Detection 실행</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dropzone Area -->
                    <div id="dropzone" onclick="document.getElementById('file-input').click()" class="border-2 border-dashed border-sage-300 hover:border-sage-500 rounded-3xl p-10 text-center cursor-pointer bg-sage-50/50 hover:bg-sage-50 transition-all duration-200">
                        <input type="file" id="file-input" multiple accept="image/*" class="hidden" onchange="handleFileSelect(event)">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-full mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-sage-500 text-2xl shadow-sm mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-images"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-sage-700">과수 이미지 파일들을 이곳에 드래그하세요</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">PNG, JPG, JPEG 지원 (최대 10개 이미지 동시 분석 가능)</p>
                        <button type="button" class="mt-4 capsule-btn px-5 py-2 bg-white text-sage-700 border border-sage-300 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-sage-100">
                            파일 선택하기
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Upload Preview List -->
                    <div id="preview-container" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-6 hidden">
                        <!-- JS populates uploaded preview thumbnails -->
                    </div>
                </div>

            </section>


            <!-- 2. 상세 페이지 SECTION (Gallery & Filter & PDF) -->
            <section id="section-gallery" class="page-section space-y-6 hidden">
                
                <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-sage-100 shadow-soft">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between pb-6 mb-6 border-b border-gray-100 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-sage-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-border-all text-sage-500"></i>
                                탐지 결과 갤러리 & 클래스 필터
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">YOLO Bounding Box 및 Confidence Score가 표시된 상세 분석 결과입니다.</p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- PDF DOWNLOAD BUTTON -->
                        <button onclick="downloadPDFReport()" class="capsule-btn px-5 py-2.5 bg-dustyRed text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-dustyRed-dark shadow-md flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i>
                            <span>방제 진단 보고서 PDF 다운로드</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 4대 클래스 필터 버튼 그룹 -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
                        <button onclick="filterGallery('all')" class="gallery-filter-btn active capsule-btn px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold bg-sage-500 text-white shadow-sm">
                            전체 (12)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="filterGallery('normal_pear')" class="gallery-filter-btn capsule-btn px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium bg-pearGold-light text-pearGold-dark hover:bg-pearGold/20">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-[8px] mr-1 text-pearGold-dark"></i> 정상배 (4)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="filterGallery('normal_apple')" class="gallery-filter-btn capsule-btn px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-100">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle text-[8px] mr-1 text-emerald-500"></i> 정상사과 (4)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="filterGallery('pear_blight')" class="gallery-filter-btn capsule-btn px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-100">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-[10px] mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> 배화상병 (2)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="filterGallery('apple_blight')" class="gallery-filter-btn capsule-btn px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium bg-dustyRed-light/40 text-dustyRed font-bold hover:bg-dustyRed-light">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-biohazard text-[10px] mr-1 text-dustyRed"></i> 사과화상병 (2)
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- GALLERY GRID -->
                    <div id="gallery-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <!-- Dynamically generated items from JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

            </section>


            <!-- 3. AI 챗봇 페이지 SECTION (Farm Assistant) -->
            <section id="section-chatbot" class="page-section space-y-6 hidden">
                
                <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-sage-100 shadow-soft overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-[700px]">
                    
                    <!-- CHAT HEADER -->
                    <div class="bg-sage-50 px-6 py-4 border-b border-sage-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sage-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-sage-700 text-sm">과수 농가 AI 닥터 (GPT-4o / Gemini 연동)</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-1">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block"></span>
                                    실시간 Session Context 데이터 주입 완료 (정상 8 / 감염 4)
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved mr-1 text-sage-500"></i>농업진흥청 매뉴얼 반영
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- QUICK ACTION CHIPS -->
                    <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-white border-b border-gray-100 flex items-center space-x-2 overflow-x-auto text-xs">
                        <span class="text-gray-400 whitespace-nowrap font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-400 mr-1"></i>빠른 질문:</span>
                        <button onclick="sendQuickPrompt('과수화상병 예방 및 발생 시 법정 매립 절차 알려줘')" class="capsule-btn px-3 py-1.5 bg-sage-50 text-sage-700 hover:bg-sage-100 border border-sage-200 whitespace-nowrap">
                            📋 과수화상병 예방 및 매립 절차
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="sendQuickPrompt('현재 탐지된 과수원 감염 상태 요약해줘')" class="capsule-btn px-3 py-1.5 bg-dustyRed-light/30 text-dustyRed hover:bg-dustyRed-light/60 border border-dustyRed/20 whitespace-nowrap font-medium">
                            📊 현재 과수원 감염 요약해줘
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="sendQuickPrompt('사과/배 화상병 초기 증상 차이점이 뭐야?')" class="capsule-btn px-3 py-1.5 bg-pearGold-light text-pearGold-dark hover:bg-pearGold/20 border border-pearGold/30 whitespace-nowrap">
                            🍎🍐 사과 vs 배 증상 차이
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- CHAT MESSAGES AREA -->
                    <div id="chat-messages" class="flex-1 p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 bg-cream/40">
                        
                        <!-- Bot Message -->
                        <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="max-w-[80%] bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none border border-sage-100 shadow-sm text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2">
                                <p class="font-bold text-sage-700">안녕하세요! 과수화상병 AI 농가 전담 도우미입니다.</p>
                                <p>현재 업로드해주신 사진에서 <span class="text-dustyRed font-bold">사과화상병 2건</span>과 <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">배화상병 2건</span>이 진단되었습니다.</p>
                                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 bg-sage-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-sage-100">
                                    💡 <strong>팁:</strong> 화상병 발생 시 확산 방지를 위해 작업 도구 소독 및 빠른 확진 신고가 핵심입니다. 궁금하신 방제 조치나 가이드라인을 질문해 주세요!
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- CHAT INPUT AREA -->
                    <div class="p-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100">
                        <form id="chat-form" onsubmit="handleChatSubmit(event)" class="flex items-center space-x-2">
